{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"啟示錄","commonName":"啟示錄","title":"啟示錄","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"1c1809dc5c0852a24fd2e98a16f1c48a0099bb5a8076dad64ee116379fb4b925","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["書卷和羔羊"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我看見坐寶座的右手中有書卷，裏外都寫着字，用七印封嚴了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我又看見一位大力的天使大聲宣傳說：「有誰配展開那書卷，揭開那七印呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["在天上、地上、地底下，沒有能展開、能觀看那書卷的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為沒有配展開、配觀看那書卷的，我就大哭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["長老中有一位對我說：「不要哭！看哪，猶大支派中的獅子，大衛的根，他已得勝，能以展開那書卷，揭開那七印。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我又看見寶座與四活物，並長老之中有羔羊站立，像是被殺過的，有七角七眼，就是上帝的七靈，奉差遣往普天下去的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["這羔羊前來，從坐寶座的右手裏拿了書卷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他既拿了書卷，四活物和二十四位長老就俯伏在羔羊面前，各拿着琴和盛滿了香的金爐；這香就是眾聖徒的祈禱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他們唱新歌，說：",{"text":"你配拿書卷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"配揭開七印；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你曾被殺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用自己的血","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從各族、各方、各民、各國中買了人來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫他們歸於上帝，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又叫他們成為國民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作祭司歸於上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在地上執掌王權。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我又看見且聽見，寶座與活物並長老的周圍有許多天使的聲音；他們的數目有千千萬萬，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["大聲說：",{"text":"曾被殺的羔羊是配得","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"權柄、豐富、智慧、能力、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尊貴、榮耀、頌讚的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我又聽見在天上、地上、地底下、滄海裏，和天地間一切所有被造之物，都說：",{"text":"但願頌讚、尊貴、榮耀、權勢","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都歸給坐寶座的和羔羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到永永遠遠！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["四活物就說：「阿們！」眾長老也俯伏敬拜。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}